WEBVTT

36:33.551 --> 36:35.178
Hit me.

36:36.554 --> 36:38.514
Go on, hit me!

36:38.639 --> 36:40.600
(SHOUTS)

36:40.725 --> 36:43.060
- I Yield!
- (LAUGHTER)

36:43.186 --> 36:45.062
Yield. Yield.

36:45.188 --> 36:47.273
I yield.

36:50.318 --> 36:52.653
You think this is funny, do you?

36:56.365 --> 37:01.078
When you're out there
beyond the Wall with the sun going down,
